{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101471","id":2272705865,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Hdr1J","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101471","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101471.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101471.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101471","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101471/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101471/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101471/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/403127553bf8b78877bc1c9c36ed761b07a8096d","number":101471,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add plural form support for Translation, OptimizedTranslation and CSV translation import.","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101464\r\n\r\nReuses same plural rule string format and handling code as PO/MO translations.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what's the best way to handle it in CSV, I have simply done parsing of multiple plural forms as subsequent lines with the same key and special `_PluralRule` line, e.g, CSV with plural forms can look like:\r\n\r\n| keys | fr |  _Comment  |\r\n| --- | --- | --- |\r\n| _PluralRule | \"nplurals=2; plural=(n >= 2);\"   | Rule string |\r\n| \"There are %d apples\" | \"Il y a %d pomme\" | Singular form      |\r\n| \"There are %d apples\" | \"Il y a %d pommes\" | First plural form  |\r\n\r\nNote: `get_plural_message` function has `plural_text` argument, which is not used by PO/MO translation, I have not used it either, and not sure why it was added, but have not removed it to avoid breaking compatibility since it is passed to GDScript/GDExtension `Translation` implementations.\r\n\r\n- *Production edit: This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1291\r\n and closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/41519 by superseding it.*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-01-12T21:48:29Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T15:11:48Z","closed_at":"2025-10-27T15:11:13Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"reque